# Accepted risks, each with a reason. Review these regularly.

# AVD-AWS-0040 / AVD-AWS-0041: public EKS API endpoint. It is restricted to
# endpoint_public_access_cidrs; set endpoint_public_access = false when CI and
# admins reach the cluster through a VPN or from inside the VPC.
AVD-AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0041

# AVD-AWS-0057: wildcard resources in IAM policies. Required by the official
# AWS Load Balancer Controller and Cluster Autoscaler read-only permissions.
AVD-AWS-0057
